# Extra label sizes, one per line: WIDTHxHEIGHT in mm or inches.
#
# Each one is added to the PPD by name, so it can be picked from the print
# dialog instead of typed into the custom fields - which matters, because some
# dialogs format a custom size with the locale decimal comma and CUPS then
# cannot parse it (see docs/INSTALL.md).
#
# Examples:
#   100x76mm
#   50x80mm
#   62x100mm
#   4x6
